From 6bc23c66aa0644691248d278047636a5bf10e508 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Aniket Randive <arandive@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Mon, 8 Sep 2025 15:51:15 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 09/12] i2c: Fix circular dependency between I2C and CCU driver

Remove export symbol functions and use function pointers
to resolve circular dependency between I2C and CCU drivers.

Change-Id: Ieb153f07f439692994f500a7978845da3085845a
Signed-off-by: Aniket Randive <arandive@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
 drivers/dma/qcom/gpi.c                |  40 ++++---
 drivers/i2c/busses/i2c-qcom-geni.c    | 160 ++++++++++++++++++--------
 drivers/soc/qcom/qcom_ccu_qup.c       |  98 ++++++++++++----
 include/linux/dma/qcom-gpi-dma.h      |   2 -
 include/linux/soc/qcom/qcom_ccu_qup.h |  26 +++--
 5 files changed, 232 insertions(+), 94 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/dma/qcom/gpi.c b/drivers/dma/qcom/gpi.c
index ea7e0020ea1c..1cc3d626248b 100644
--- a/drivers/dma/qcom/gpi.c
+++ b/drivers/dma/qcom/gpi.c
@@ -18,6 +18,7 @@
